<title>USA: Standard Financial gets ok for buyback.</title>
<headline>Standard Financial gets ok for buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Financial Inc said Monday it received approval from the Department of the Treasury, Office of Thrift Supervision to repurchase up to 10 percent of the company's outstanding common shares over the next six months.</p>
<p>It said the purchased stock will be used to fulfill its obligation under a variety of its benefit plans and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The company currently has 16.2 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
